libmas

    Collection of minimal assemblers.


Building

    Currently, only ARM Thum-2 platform back end is implemented. You can
directly build this project using `make -j` if you are on an ARM computer. To
cross-compile from another CPU architecture, you can install GNU ARM
cross-compiler:

                # vvv your operating system's ARM cross-compiler
    export CC=arm-linux-gnueabi-gcc
    export AR=arm-linux-gnueabi-ar
    make -j
